<chapter_n chapter_n="18">
<verse_n verse_n="1">
<translation translation="Now the intellect of man hath not the ability to discover by enquiry by what means God became man, and in what way God, Who is impassible, and is One, and is, moreover, not of the earth, took form to Himself in the flesh.">
