<verse_n verse_n="1">
<translation translation="We do not divide the Natures into two Persons, but the two natures are one Person, and proceed from the divinity and manhood of the economy of the Son, which maketh (them) to become one of one with Him. As the result of the oneness, which it is impossible to describe, He becometh the Only-begotten Son.">
