<verse_n verse_n="2">
<translation translation="We call Him the Son of God, because He is God the Word in very truth, and because He is the wisdom and the intelligence (or, mind) which are inseparable from the Father according to (His) nature (even as the two animals which are yoked together and are driven by the charioteer), God and man.">
